29. **Traceable Decisions** – Agents must embed an HTML comment `<!-- decision:[RuleIDs] -->` in every diff.
30. **Token-Cost Ceiling** – Reject diffs that raise template token estimates >20 % unless accompanied by an offsetting cost reduction elsewhere.
31. **Performance Budget** – PR fails if unit benchmarks exceed baseline runtime by 15 %.
32. **Emotion Score Floor** – Outbound copy must score ≥ 8/10 via `output-emotion-score.md`; otherwise PR is blocked.
33. **Analytics Coverage** – All new functions must emit SystemEvents logs containing `sessionId` & `status`.
34. **Privacy Guard** – Never write raw PII to logs; hash or redact before emission.
35. **Chaos Canary** – Each release must include at least one synthetic failure test that asserts self‑healing.
36. **Rule-Coverage Comment** – PR descriptions must list affected Rule IDs as a checklist.
37. **Expiry Metadata** – TODO comments require an ISO expiry date; CI fails when date ≤ today.
38. **Adaptive Rule Embeds** – Agents must vector‑search rules and load only those ≥ 0.5 similarity to the task.
